BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:York Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T180000
UID:74f9b56c8ace2216bf14fcd2072cddbd@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/York%20Fair_20260709154859733123.JPG
DESCRIPTION:Support Nancy Mannion at the York Fair! Stop by and say hello!
  She will be joining the York Dems at their table at the Fair on Saturday 
 evening\, July 25th from 6:00 -9:00 pm. Mark your calendar for the iconic 
 York State Fair\, America's first fair\, celebrating community and agricul
 ture with rides\, concerts\, and delicious food.
LOCATION:York State Fair\, 334 Carlisle Ave\, York\, PA\, 17404
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/citizensfornancymannion/event/986960/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Columbia Democratic Committee Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T163000
UID:973a830e59a3c24dfc35d68353b81552@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize_CDC_20240516182011240934_20260105171820176157.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Columbia Democratic Committee meets on the second Monday o
 f each month at 6:30 pm to discuss upcoming elections\, meet local candida
 tes for office\, plan volunteer actions and get-out-the-vote events\, and 
 more. This is a public meeting open to all local Democrats! Meetings take 
 place in the Columbia Library Community Room. As you enter the library\, g
 o to the left past the front desk and turn right to go down to the basemen
 t. You can also support our efforts by making a donation!
LOCATION:Columbia Public Library\, 24 S 6th St 1599\, Columbia\, PA\, 1751
 2
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/898958/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
