BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Democracy Rocks! Rock Painting Party and ETown Dems Monthly Meetin
 g
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T173000
UID:28318c520cbd51c100db240b29bd75c8@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Gemini_Generated_Image_6a0clr6a0clr6a0c_20260709140117457996.
 png
DESCRIPTION:At this special edition of our monthly meeting\, we are having
  a community rock painting party! Join us (bring the kids!) to paint rocks
  with patriotic and inclusive themes that build and support community. Don
 ate rocks to be displayed at our polling locations and the Etown Fair\, or
  take your rocks and drop them to be tracked via QR code. Let's see how fa
 r our messages can travel!
LOCATION:Elizabethtown\, PA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/986869/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
